	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"Figure-riseMechanics ドラえもん登場！Figure-riseMechanicsはロボットの内部メカニックを組み立てる新境地へ！■ドラえもんの特徴的な「ペタリハンド」や「ウルトラ・スーパー・デラックス・コンピュータ」などの内部メカのディテールを精密に再現！■組み立てていくことで、ドラえもんの内部メカが理解でき、よりドラえもんを知ることができます！■外装パーツは、通常のブルーの他に、内部メカが透けて見えるクリア外装も付属！組み立てた後も内部メカが見えるディスプレイが楽しめます。■タイムマシン座り用パーツが付属し、同時発売「Figure-riseMechanics ドラえもんのひみつ道具 タイムマシン」に乗せることも可能です。■口を別パーツにすることでシールレスを実現。さらに作りやすくなった！"
		],
		"en": [
			"Figure-riseMechanics Doraemon appears! Figure-riseMechanics takes you to a new frontier in assembling the internal mechanics of robots! ■Details of Doraemon's characteristic \"petari hand\" and internal mechanisms such as \"Ultra Super Deluxe Computer\" are precisely reproduced! ■By going through Assembly, you can understand Doraemon's internal mechanism and get to know Doraemon even more! ■In addition to the usual blue exterior parts, a clear exterior that allows you to see the internal mechanism is also included! Enjoy the display that allows you to see the internal mechanism even after assembly. ■Parts for sitting the time machine are included, and it can also be placed on the \"Figure-riseMechanics Doraemon's Secret Tool Time Machine\" released at the same time. ■ Seal-less is achieved by making the mouth a separate part. It's even easier to make!"
		]
	},
